    "answer": "indigestion/dyspepsia | incomprehensibility/inability-to-understand",
    "mnemonic": "You've hopefully seen <ja>消化</ja> by now and know that it means \"digestion.\" If you know that, then you can see that the \"digestion\" is <kanji>not</kanji> <kanji>good</kanji>. When your digestion is not good, what do you have? <vocabulary>Indigestion</vocabulary>. Excuse me, I have to run to the restroom...",
